==Battleground==
*2 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 8.33~15 seconds<sup>250f~450f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 38 seconds<sup>1,140f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*3 [[LeMurr]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 50~100 seconds<sup>1,500f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the strength of these aliens, it is recommended to first activate at least all of [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1's [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|Crystal treasure]] before attempting this stage.

